UART - Universal Asynchronous Receiver and Transmitter.<br>
This is a serial communication protocol.<br>
Usually used as a debugging method.<br>
The STM32F446RE has it named as USART.<br>
USART2 is the one I configured here.<br>
Since USART2 is typically connected to the ST-LINK for communication with  PC via virtual COM port (USB).<br>
